Package: ssh3c-libssl3
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: ssh3-c maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6
Breaks: ssh3-server (<= 0.5.1)
Replaces: ssh3-server (<= 0.5.1)
Description: the bundled OpenSSL 3.5 shared libraries of ssh3-c
 The unmodified Debian 13 libssl3t64 shared libraries (3.5.x, the
 QUIC TLS API) installed in the private /usr/lib/ssh3-c/lib/: the
 ssh3 binaries pin this directory with their RUNPATH, so the system
 libssl (any version, e.g. the 3.0.x of mint 22.x / ubuntu 24.04) is
 neither required nor touched.
